statements.statement:
For every \(\mathbf P=(P_n)\in
\mathcal B_{\epsilon,M,c_0,v_0,v_1}\), let \(I_0\) be the pilot fold in
\(\mathcal I\).  There is
\(c=\epsilon c_0/(16K_0)>0\) such that, for all sufficiently large \(n\),
\[
 Q_{P_n}^{(n)}\!\left\{
   \min_{a\in\{0,1\},\,1\le k\le d_n}N_{ak}^{(0)}
   \le256\log(en)\right\}
 \le2d_nK_0\exp\!\left(-c\frac{n}{d_n}\right)=o(1).
\]
